if DAC_ES8388

    config ES8388_MAX_VOLUME
        int "Maximum DAC volume (dB)"
        range -96 0
        default -20
        help
            Maximum volume level in dB that corresponds to AirPlay volume 0 dB.
            The ES8388 master DAC volume register range is 0 dB to -96 dB.
            A value of -20 means AirPlay full volume maps to -20 dB on the DAC
            (this board also has an external amp stage after the codec, so
            0 dB here would usually be uncomfortably loud).

endif # DAC_ES8388
